   "dot": "slate",
   "title": "Scope",
   "items": [
    "13 of the 49 tables: reports, similarity, notifications, and the users, placements and files they point to",
    "Columns typed \"· FK x.id\" reference tables outside this slice: colleges, companies, applications, training_cycles, vacancies, universities",
    "Every column comes from backend/app/models at the pinned commit, including columns added by later migrations"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "violet",
   "title": "Composite and partial unique keys",
   "items": [
    "report_versions (slot_id, version_no) unique; one draft per slot: unique slot_id where submitted_at IS NULL",
    "similarity_matches (check_id, source_version_id) unique; check_id cascades on delete",
    "placements: one non-cancelled placement per (student_id, cycle_id)",
    "users: unique lower(email); one company admin per company; one verified active coordinator per college"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "amber",
   "title": "Check constraints",
   "items": [
    "report_slots.status: draft, submitted, revision_requested, accepted, closed_missing; week_no set only for weekly slots",
    "report_reviews: a revision_requested decision needs a non-empty comment",
    "notifications email_status / push_status: pending, sent, failed, skipped",
    "similarity_checks.status: pending, done, failed; decision and decision_comment are set together"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "cyan",
   "title": "Indexes worth knowing",
   "items": [
    "report_passages.embedding: HNSW halfvec_cosine_ops for the kNN search",
    "notifications: partial outbox index on created_at where email or push is pending",
    "report_slots (status, due_at) for the Missing and reminder jobs"
   ]
  }
